# Rendered manuscript figure outputs. These are regenerated from tracked source
# (manuscript/Fig1_behavior_candidates/build_fig1_candidates.R and
# manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/R/), so the
# builders are versioned but their staged SVG/PDF/PNG products are not. The
# schema rendered/ directory alone is ~4.9 MB of PNG.
#
# This replaces a blanket `/manuscript` rule, which also ignored the tracked
# source files under manuscript/Fig1_behavior_candidates/ -- blocking `git add`
# on them -- and hid the manuscript verification scripts under
# manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/R/ from
# version control entirely.
manuscript/Fig1_behavior_candidates/rendered/
manuscript/archive/BehavioralDynamics_schema_preproduction_audit/rendered/

# Local publication release bundles built by
# Analysis/build_publication_release.R are written to the local RFID output
# root, never into the repository. This rule only guards against an accidental
# in-repo build target.
releases/
